## 首触邮件（英文样板 · 可直接发送）

**主题**：PoE switching for your projects

```text
Hi Iyiola,

I found Millie Evolution on the MikroTik consultant list - five certifications including MTCINE.

We build managed PoE switches with a full L2+ table (Voice VLAN, ERPS, watchdog). Keeps this note short since your public pages are still being built.

One question: in your client projects, is the switching layer ever open for alternatives?

If yes, I can send the feature table and an evaluation unit. If not, one line and I close the loop.

Best regards,
Saga Telecom - PoE switch OEM/ODM
```

> 发送前检查：① 不出现「Made in China」或原产地信息；② 不承诺未实测的指标；③ 落款换成你自己的名字与公司；④ **一次只问一个问题**；⑤ 货币单位一律 USD 并带快照日期；⑥ 该客户为教师/公立身份时先读「本户特别红线」。

